{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55033","headline":"兵要望江南 禳厌第二十四（京本作「占厌禳第十九」○十三首） 十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 禳厌第二十四（京本作「占厌禳第十九」○十三首） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬兵吉（京本作「禳兵告」），顿在（辛本、川本、京本作「须向」）九天方。\n诸恶不成加喜气。\n更宜上将见恩光，安得（京本作「将」）有乖张。\n（《太乙式》云：「九天之上，可以陈兵，九地之下，可以潜伏。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}